---
title: Library entry points
---
flowchart LR
  authoring[./authoring<br/>parse · mutate · lint]
  interpreter[./interpreter<br/>subset · step machine · ReasoningPort]
  openspec[./openspec<br/>ontology schemas and rules]
  pi[./pi<br/>ReasoningPort on pi-ai]
  claudecode[./claude-code<br/>port and pi provider · Node only]
  durable[./durable<br/>agentscript.run · no node: imports]
  nodeentry[./node<br/>localWorkspace · builtins · runners]
  mcp[./mcp<br/>MCP tools and bridge · Node only]
  cloudflare[./cloudflare<br/>Durable Object host · Workers only]
  task[./task<br/>task · group · change · spec loops]
  cli[./cli<br/>specsesh main · USAGE]
  bins[agentscript-* bins<br/>pi · durable · task · change]
  deps[dependencies<br/>@sf-agentscript/* · typebox, exact]
  peers[optional peers<br/>pi-ai · pi-durable · chord · MCP SDK · agents]
  build[build<br/>tsc to dist · .agent scripts · chmod bins]
  layers[layers.test.ts<br/>the import graph holds]
  pack[pack:check<br/>both tarballs into empty projects]
  specsesh[specsesh package<br/>npx specsesh · pins the Node peers]
  hello[hello-world example<br/>a durable run on Claude Code]
  worker[cloudflare-worker example<br/>wrangler dev --local]

  %% An arrow is a runtime import. Type-only imports, and imports implied by another arrow, are left out.
  interpreter -->|parse| authoring
  authoring -->|ast · subset| interpreter
  authoring -->|@sf-agentscript/*| deps
  openspec -->|typebox| deps
  pi -->|implements ReasoningPort| interpreter
  pi -->|pi-ai| peers
  claudecode -->|tool rounds · categories| pi
  durable -->|step machine| interpreter
  durable -->|records with| openspec
  durable -->|pi-durable · chord| peers
  nodeentry --> durable
  mcp -->|tool bridge| claudecode
  mcp -->|MCP SDK| peers
  cloudflare --> durable
  cloudflare -->|agents| peers
  task --> nodeentry
  task -->|pickTests port| claudecode
  bins --> task
  bins -.->|lazy| mcp
  cli -->|in-process| bins
  specsesh --> cli
  specsesh -.->|exact versions, all but agents| peers
  hello --> durable
  hello --> claudecode
  worker --> cloudflare
  layers -.->|Node-free| durable
  layers -.->|alone speaks MCP| mcp
  layers -.->|alone touches Workers| cloudflare
  build -.->|copies .agent scripts| task
  build -.->|chmod| bins
  pack -.->|packs · installs · imports every entry| build

